---
/**
 * FlakeCauses — the six things an intermittent failure actually is, and the
 * fix each one implies. The bottom row is the fix everybody reaches for and
 * the reason it is the wrong one.
 */
---

<figure class="lu-figure flake">
  <div class="lu-figure__frame">
    <p class="trigger">A test fails one run in twenty</p>
    <p class="prompt">Which of these six is it? Answer before touching the test.</p>

    <ol class="causes">
      <li>
        <span class="cause">Shared state between tests</span>
        <span class="fix">Per-worker data, and a fixture instead of a shared variable</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="cause">A wait on a duration</span>
        <span class="fix">Wait for the condition, with a deadline</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="cause">Real time, or a time zone</span>
        <span class="fix">A clock the test controls</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="cause">An ordering assumption</span>
        <span class="fix">Assert on the outcome, and test the reordered delivery</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="cause">Animation or focus timing</span>
        <span class="fix">Wait for the settled state, not the transition</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="cause">A load-dependent environment</span>
        <span class="fix">Bound the resource, or move the check to a cheaper level</span>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p class="trap">
      <span class="trap__label">The tempting fix</span>
      <span class="trap__struck">add a retry</span>
      <span class="trap__why">
        It makes all six disappear from the report, and hides the one cause
        that is not a test problem at all — a real race in the product, like
        <code>TRAIL-STOCK-OVERSELL</code>, which then ships.
      </span>
    </p>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="lu-figure__caption">
    Step 10. Flake is a defect with an owner, and every cause has a different fix.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .trigger {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: var(--lu-radius-control);
    background: var(--lu-surface-2);
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }

  .prompt {
    margin: 0.625rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }

  .causes {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: cause;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
  }

  .causes li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(11rem, 1fr) 1.6fr;
    gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 0.625rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
    counter-increment: cause;
  }

  .cause {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 510;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }

  .cause::before {
    content: counter(cause);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--lu-marker);
  }

  .fix {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }

  .trap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(11rem, 1fr) 1.6fr;
    gap: 0.25rem 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--sl-color-red-high);
    border-radius: var(--lu-radius-control);
    background: var(--sl-color-red-low);
  }

  .trap__label {
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--sl-color-red-high);
  }

  .trap__struck {
    grid-column: 1;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 510;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: var(--sl-color-red-high);
  }

  .trap__why {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1 / span 2;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }

  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    .causes li,
    .trap {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .trap__why,
    .trap__struck {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
